        "heading": "Bicycle Safety",
        "image": "assets/illustrations/bicycle_safety_family.png",
        "imagePosition": "right",
        "bulletIcon": "assets/illustrations/bicycle_bullet.png",
        "bulletStartIndex": 1,
        "paragraphs": [
          "Here are some helpful tips that will keep you safe while riding a bicycle.",
          "Always wear a properly fitted bicycle helmet.",
          "Check your equipment, control your bike, and don't ride your bike at night.",
          "Go with the traffic flow, not against it. Ride on the right side of the road in the same direction as other vehicles.",
          "Obey all traffic laws, stop at STOP signs and traffic lights, yield to traffic, stay alert at all times, and look before turning.",
          "If you need to cross a street, walk your bike across; don't ride across it."
        ]
      },
